{"seq":1,"slug":"technical-writing","title":"技术文档写作","stage":"DONE","category":"writing","chapterCount":5,"docCount":20,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/writing/technical-writing","rating":{"composite":4.1,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4.2,"coverage":3.75,"positioning":4.5,"strategic":4},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3.57,"verdict":"consider","uScore":4}},"introMarkdown":"# 技术文档写作 简介\n\n优秀的技术文档是软件项目成功的关键因素之一。无论是 API 参考文档、用户指南、架构设计文档还是内部知识库，清晰准确的技术写作能够显著降低团队沟通成本，提升产品的可用性和可维护性。然而，许多开发者虽然具备扎实的技术能力，却在将知识转化为文字时感到力不从心。\n\n本知识库面向所有需要撰写技术文档的从业者，包括软件工程师、技术负责人、产品经理以及技术写作专员。无论你是第一次编写 README，还是正在构建企业级文档体系，这里都能为你提供系统化的方法论与实践指导。\n\n知识库将覆盖以下主题：技术写作的基本原则与风格规范，帮助你建立清晰简洁的表达习惯；文档架构设计，教你如何组织信息层级和导航结构；不同类型文档的写作方法，涵盖教程、参考手册、变更日志和故障排查指南等常见场景；文档工具链，介绍主流的文档生成与发布工具；以及文档维护策略，确保文档与代码始终保持同步。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"writing-fundamentals","title":"技术写作基础","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/writing/technical-writing/writing-fundamentals","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"principles-and-style","title":"写作原则与风格","url":"/l-doc-books/h/writing/technical-writing/writing-fundamentals/principles-and-style"},{"seq":2,"slug":"audience-and-information-architecture","title":"受众分析与信息架构","url":"/l-doc-books/h/writing/technical-writing/writing-fundamentals/audience-and-information-architecture"},{"seq":3,"slug":"clarity-and-conciseness","title":"清晰与简洁","url":"/l-doc-books/h/writing/technical-writing/writing-fundamentals/clarity-and-conciseness"},{"seq":4,"slug":"toolchain","title":"工具链","url":"/l-doc-books/h/writing/technical-writing/writing-fundamentals/toolchain"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"api-documentation","title":"API 文档","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/writing/technical-writing/api-documentation","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"api-reference-design","title":"API 参考文档设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/writing/technical-writing/api-documentation/api-reference-design"},{"seq":2,"slug":"endpoint-descriptions","title":"接口描述规范","url":"/l-doc-books/h/writing/technic